# The Marine Tube (a glass walk along the sea floor, light rippling through the water above): a slow celesta tune in E minor
# drifting over a held string pad, a harp's falling arpeggios and a deep, slow bass, no beat. The tube plays the same by day and
# by night. Original composition for this game (plan 22 · U8, part b).
